        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/two-point-museum-rides.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Well this made me chuckle. After starting out with <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/two-point-hospital\">Two Point Hospital</a> - a spiritual successor to developer Bullfrog Productions' classic sick-fixing sim Theme Hospital, Two Point Studios is now going even further into the past. Its newly announced Rides & Relics DLC for the excellent Two Point Museum is paying it back to Theme Hospital's much-loved predecessor, Theme Park - and you can even build your own coasters!</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/two-point-museum-rides-and-relics-dlc-announced\">Read more</a></p>",
